hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"23875","Yunus narrated to us, Layth narrated to us from Yazid, meaning Ibn Abi Habib, from Muhammad ibn Ishaq from Muhammad ibn Talhah ibn Yazid ibn Rukanah that his maternal aunt, the sister of Mas'ud ibn al-Ajma, narrated to him that her father said to the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) about the Makhzumiyyah who stole a cloak, he would ransom her, meaning with forty uqiyyah, so the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: For her to be purified is better for her, so he ordered her and her hand was cut, and she is of Banu Abdilasad."
